    text: "Affected stops:\r\nE Mountain View Ave & Alpine St (#25157) (eastbound)\r\nE Mountain View Ave & Independence Dr (#25158) (eastbound)\r\nPace St & Mountain View Ave (#25159) (eastbound)\r\nMountain View Ave & Pace St (#25168) (westbound)\r\nE Mountain View Ave & Alpine St (#25170) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 323 get on/off buses at:\r\nAlpine St & E Mountain View Ave (#12174)\r\nPace St & Red Oak Dr (#25161)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 323 get on/off buses at:\r\nPace St & Red Oak Dr (#25167)\r\nAlpine St & Independence Dr (#17490)"
